      "text": "{\"v\":1,\"gateId\":\"gateTrafficReport00000\",\"hours\":[{\"hour\":1798675200,\"route\":\"newsletter\",\"requests\":0,\"s2\":0,\"s3\":0,\"s4\":0,\"s5\":0,\"errors\":{},\"msTotal\":0,\"msMax\":0}]}",
      "expect": {
        "ok": false,
        "code": "report_invalid"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "another version",
      "text": "{\"v\":2,\"gateId\":\"gateTrafficReport00000\",\"hours\":[]}",
      "expect": {
        "ok": false,
        "code": "report_invalid"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a gate id of the wrong shape",
      "text": "{\"v\":1,\"gateId\":\"short\",\"hours\":[]}",
      "expect": {
        "ok": false,
        "code": "report_invalid"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "duplicate keys: the last one counts (as strict JSON everywhere in Moat)",
      "text": "{\"v\":1,\"v\":1,\"gateId\":\"gateTrafficReport00000\",\"hours\":[]}",
      "expect": {
        "ok": true,
        "report": {
          "v": 1,
          "gateId": "gateTrafficReport00000",
          "hours": []
        }
      }
